title: 2 dependency cycles
status: completed
conclusion: failure

--- summary ---
Waves cannot be ordered because `depends_on` and `reads_state` edges form a cycle. Remove one edge of each cycle, or suppress an inferred edge with `ignore_inferred`.

- `stacks/a → stacks/b → stacks/a`
- `stacks/x → stacks/y → stacks/z → stacks/x`

**Warnings**

- inferred edge stacks/y -\> stacks/z

